1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,039
Si no haces esto

2
00:00:01,049 --> 00:00:01,866
en GTA 6...

3
00:00:01,982 --> 00:00:02,791
puedes perder TODO tu

4
00:00:02,801 --> 00:00:03,332
dinero.

5
00:00:03,747 --> 00:00:04,321
Esto es lo que

6
00:00:04,331 --> 00:00:05,305
Rockstar ya ha enseñado

7
00:00:05,315 --> 00:00:06,278
sobre cómo hacerse rico

8
00:00:06,288 --> 00:00:06,982
en Leonida.

9
00:00:07,398 --> 00:00:08,010
PASO 1:

10
00:00:08,095 --> 00:00:09,270
empieza por lo pequeño.

11
00:00:09,873 --> 00:00:10,977
Tiendas y gasolineras...

12
00:00:11,061 --> 00:00:11,991
dinero en efectivo,

13
00:00:12,096 --> 00:00:13,129
directo al bolsillo.

14
00:00:13,544 --> 00:00:14,177
PASO 2:

15
00:00:14,231 --> 00:00:15,201
apunta más alto.

16
00:00:15,799 --> 00:00:16,701
En los golpes grandes

17
00:00:16,711 --> 00:00:17,795
no siempre hay billetes:

18
00:00:17,859 --> 00:00:18,451
hay joyas,

19
00:00:18,525 --> 00:00:19,311
lingotes de oro...

20
00:00:19,437 --> 00:00:20,008
o droga.

21
00:00:20,428 --> 00:00:21,143
PASO 3:

22
00:00:21,258 --> 00:00:21,924
ese botín no vale

23
00:00:21,934 --> 00:00:22,508
nada hasta que se

24
00:00:22,518 --> 00:00:23,041
lo vendes a un

25
00:00:23,051 --> 00:00:23,684
perista.

26
00:00:24,277 --> 00:00:25,289
Hay uno para joyas,

27
00:00:25,445 --> 00:00:26,170
otro para el oro,

28
00:00:26,275 --> 00:00:27,103
otro para la droga...

29
00:00:27,228 --> 00:00:27,956
y se desbloquean con

30
00:00:27,966 --> 00:00:28,670
la historia.

31
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:29,846
PASO 4:

32
00:00:29,971 --> 00:00:31,188
roba coches por encargo.

33
00:00:31,786 --> 00:00:32,644
Te llegan al móvil...

34
00:00:32,749 --> 00:00:33,405
y te pagan según

35
00:00:33,415 --> 00:00:34,407
cómo llegue el coche.

36
00:00:35,014 --> 00:00:36,087
Si está destrozado,

37
00:00:36,223 --> 00:00:37,050
cobras menos.

38
00:00:37,466 --> 00:00:38,121
Y ojo al error

39
00:00:38,131 --> 00:00:39,041
que te puede arruinar:

40
00:00:39,146 --> 00:00:39,884
si mueres con mucho

41
00:00:39,894 --> 00:00:40,752
efectivo encima,

42
00:00:40,888 --> 00:00:42,043
puedes perder buena parte...

43
00:00:42,281 --> 00:00:42,781
o TODO.

44
00:00:43,379 --> 00:00:44,147
Pasa antes por el

45
00:00:44,157 --> 00:00:44,729
cajero.

46
00:00:45,144 --> 00:00:46,118
Esto es lo confirmado

47
00:00:46,128 --> 00:00:47,242
antes del lanzamiento.

48
00:00:47,845 --> 00:00:48,979
¿Cuánto dinero llevas tú?

49
00:00:49,577 --> 00:00:50,743
Te leo en comentarios.

